                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/535: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Argentina</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Cox</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-08-08T12:00:00-04:00">August 8, 1936—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>103. For Braden. Your 157, August 7, 9 p.m. The Department approves the procedure
                    outlined in your telegram under reference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
